## No warranty, and not financial advice

This project is for educational purposes. The calculations are illustrations driven
by assumptions the reader chooses, not predictions, and **automatic calculation may
make mistakes**. Tax rules change and the figures here can fall out of date.

Nothing here is investment, tax, or legal advice. Before making financial decisions,
consult a certified financial advisor and confirm current tax rules with the Thai
Revenue Department (rd.go.th).

The author accepts no liability for decisions made on the basis of this material.

## Privacy

No data from users is collected. The site has no accounts, no analytics, no cookies,
and no server-side code. Every calculation runs in the visitor's own browser and is
never transmitted anywhere. The only thing stored on a visitor's device is their
choice of language.

